{"Title":"An Act establishing a sick leave bank for Meredith Mingolelli-Cotter","BillNumber":"S2372","DocketNumber":"SD2453","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T18:22:37.257"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T18:22:37.2566667"},{"Id":"MRS1","Name":"Margaret R. Scarsdale","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T17:06:13.3866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2372/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Kennedy, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2372) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Edward J. Kennedy and Margaret R. Scarsdale for legislation to establish a sick leave bank for Meredith Mingolelli-Cotter.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the trial court of the commonwealth shall establish a sick leave bank for Meredith Mingolelli-Cotter, an employee of the trial court. Any employee of the trial court may voluntarily contribute 1 or more sick, personal or vacation days to the sick leave bank for use by Meredith Mingolelli-Cotter. If Meredith Mingolelli-Cotter terminates employment with the trial court or requests to dissolve the sick leave bank, any remaining time in the sick leave bank shall be transferred to the trial court paid leave bank. Sick leave bank days shall not be used for absences unrelated to the illness or disability that necessitated the establishment of the sick leave bank as determined by the trial court.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2372","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2372/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}